> On Sat, Mar 31, 2018 at 12:16:49AM +0300, Andy Shevchenko wrote:
>> On Wed, Mar 28, 2018 at 8:46 PM, Manivannan Sadhasivam
>> <manivannan.sadhasivam@linaro.org> wrote:
>>> +static const struct pinconf_ops owl_pinconf_ops = {
